=2 Walkthrough
* Receive the mission from {n:Rasdinice}.
* Join {p:Campaign Battles|Category:Campaign Battle} in {p:Orcish Hosts|https://ffxiclopedia.fandom.com/wiki/Orcish_Hosts} controlled areas.
* After completing the Objective, report back to {n:Rasdinice} to complete the mission.

=2 Notes
* To complete this mission you MUST participate in Campaign battles in Beastmen controlled zones.
* You need 3000 EXP to complete this Campaign Op.
* You will receive your mission reward along with the Campaign battle assessment immediately after your objective has been completed.

=2 Game Description
\**Client:** {n:Rasdinice} - {z:Southern San d'Oria (S)} (I-9)
\**Summary:** The kingdom has set plans in motion to carry out attacks on Beastman Confederate strongholds in a series of strategic Campaign battles. Assist the Knights of the Iron Ram in the siege of these key tactical positions.
